From f5d6eabd4955cde92d5265eb85c719546412184a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:52:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Tools: SpotPass Tasks window with Run Now (Build 149)

Tools > SpotPass Tasks lists every task the SpotPass module has registered (from
its save, BOSS_SV.db / BOSS_SS.db: interval at 0x28, runs left 0x2C, last run
0x30 in seconds since 2000, state 0x40, HTTP status 0x48; read from a real save
on 7 Nov 2026): game (name and icon from the game list), task, every, last run,
result, next run (due now / time and countdown), runs left, address. Refreshes
every 10 s and stays open next to the game.

Run Now (or double-click) downloads the task's file at once with Tangelo's own
SpotPass downloader (the custom SpotPass server applies, Akamai addresses too)
and stores its contents in the game's SpotPass storage like the SpotPass module
does after a run (OnlineService::RunTaskNow, on a worker thread). Upload tasks
and tasks without an address can't be run. For DEAD OR ALIVE Dimensions, whose
tasks the module doesn't run while the game is in front.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
